      "comment": "DOMINANT XENA (6) rocketed out of the boxes with a strong early sectional but gathered in and finished in the minors when second (17.07) at this track over 300m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. One of the leading chances. FEDERAL ESCAPE (1) has been settling off the speed lately, finishing fourth (17.56) last time in a Grade 5 at this track. Form here at the trip sound including three wins. Has ability and can measure up. RIPPLE ROSE (7) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (17.11) at this track in a Grade 5 over 300m. Hard to beat again. TODOROKI (3) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
